# Copy that ships with Jake's name on it, for ~/.claude/voice/check-voice: the site's pages, the
# store's texts and the README. Not the changelog or its feed, which ship Claude's wording as
# drafted with the disclosure line (CLAUDE.md), and not the app's strings, which stay under the
# [COPY - Jake] marker alone: hashing a source file would want a signature on every code change.
README.md
site/index.html
site/help/index.html
site/privacy/index.html
site/check/index.html
site/mac-security-camera/index.html
site/store/*.txt
